<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson says wins Austrian pager deal.</title>
<headline>Ericsson says wins Austrian pager deal.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms group LM Ericsson AB said on Monday it had signed a contract with the Austrian AirPage Telekommunikation AG under which it will supply paging systems based on the System T paging platform.  </p>
<p>Ericsson said in a statement the introduction of AirPage's new paging system would give national coverage by 1997.</p>
<p>The value of the order was not specified.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
